    "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#d8d769\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\">· 8月更新内容前瞻</span></strong></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"5c86e08ef49919b119add25391740f2a\" alt=\"8月1.png\" title=\"8月1.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20240715/5c86e08ef49919b119add25391740f2a.png\" width=\"1000px\" style=\"width:1000px\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#d8d769\"><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><strong>·</strong></span></span> <span style=\"color:#d8d769\"><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\">休养模式</span></strong></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"6ecbebf93e04c5da839495d2778bcfbf\" alt=\"休养模式.png\" title=\"休养模式.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20240724/6ecbebf93e04c5da839495d2778bcfbf.png\" width=\"1000px\" style=\"width:1000px\"/></div><p><span style=\"color:#d8d769\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:1em\">【休养模式】版本更新后开启</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#919191\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:1em\">休养模式下，大地图不再随生息日推进自然生成敌袭，流程中只存在主动触发的敌袭，您可以享受和平探索与建造的乐趣。</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#d8d769\"><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><strong>·</strong></span></span> <span style=\"color:#d8d769\"><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\">战争浪潮</span></strong></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"eab903ae963057eb4f125b4c4ff1abf2\" alt=\"8月2.png\" title=\"8月2.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20240715/eab903ae963057eb4f125b4c4ff1abf2.png\" width=\"1000px\" style=\"width:1000px\"/></div><p><span style=\"color:#d8d769\">【战争浪潮】荒野的救赎</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#919191\">习惯荒野和习惯监狱哪个更糟？监狱里的人会说监狱，荒野里的人会说荒野，这就是战斗爆发的原因。</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#d8d769\"><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\">· 繁荣馈赠</span></span></strong></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"5473b2acdd7371c3ab9ac71d38e98998\" alt=\"8月3.png\" title=\"8月3.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20240715/5473b2acdd7371c3ab9ac71d38e98998.png\" width=\"1000px\" style=\"width:1000px\"/></div><p><span style=\"color:#d8d769\">【繁荣馈赠】第九层开启</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#919191\">【繁荣馈赠】上限扩充，奖励扩充</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#d8d769\">【8月稀有奖励】“枯荣”</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#919191\">盛去荒来，焚风依旧。与沙洲同生息的，只有那些在逼仄的空间里探寻可能性的生命。</span></p>",
